+## 4. Claims tested
+
+- **"Signal still firing?"** — No. Last red 1795562194; five clear samples through 1795563336. The
+  case is at 19/20 clear and will auto-close with a machine record. I did not close it, and I do not
+  treat an auto-clear as a repair.
+- **"Material impediment reported or suppressed?"** — No inbox report exists. Absence is not
+  evidence of health; it only means there is no Executive report to disposition.
+- **"Root cause identified and repaired?"** — **Unverified.** No diagnosis artifact, no code or
