+  transient readiness flaps are a measurement observation for Parliament; they are not proof of
+  misconduct, neglect or defective delivery.
+
+## 5. Disposition
+
+**Transient, self-cleared branch-readiness flap during Executive agent startup/turnover; root cause
+unverified; no material blocker reported; no delivery claim verified or refuted.** Case state was
+not edited. It remains open in durable state and is subject to the collector's automatic closure at
+20 consecutive clear observations (Founder directive 2026-11-16), not to any judicial act. A live,
+running agent is not evidence of useful delivery, and a clear signal is not a clean bill of health.
+
+Owner for any operational investigation or repair: **Executive**, under existing authority. Legal
+questions about recurrence or auto-closure: **Parliament**. This disposition is submitted as
+evidence only.
+
+## 6. Limitations
+
+- No host telemetry and no archived snapshot of the single unhealthy sample; the exact trigger
+  (cycle not accepted vs agent status unreadable vs disallowed agent state) cannot be established.
+- Live agent status was read once at 23:36Z — a point observation, not a history of the flap window.
+- I did not re-run suites, inspect delivery artifacts or verify any Executive work product. This
